<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/31/eng@/~cl_35__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any investigation, trial or proceedings done, taken or commenced under the principal Act immediately before the coming into operation of this Act, shall be dealt with as if the principal Act had not been amended by this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/31/eng@> .
